         <fo:block id="d207e2511">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Managing the RMT</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>131.6</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Managing the RMT</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The RMT is not a native TR-069 model as it is not defined by BBF and
    it takes advantage of the Dmt Admin features. This section therefore shows
    a number of examples how the RMT can be managed from an ACS.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">For example, on a specific CPE the following bundles are installed,
    the given name is the location</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                      hyphenate="false"
                      wrap-option="no-wrap"
                      white-space-collapse="false"
                      white-space-treatment="preserve"
                      linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                      text-align="start"
                      font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                      font-size="9pt"
                      letter-spacing="-.0em"
                      space-before="5pt"
                      space-after="3pt"
                      space-after.conditionality="retain"
                      start-indent="inherit"
                      line-height="11pt"
                      id="d207e2515">System Bundle
org-apache-felix-webconsole
org-apache-felix-configadmin
org-eclipse-equinox-scr
jp-co-ntt-admin
de-telekom-shell</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The intention is to:</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                           space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                           space-after.optimum="1em"
                           space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                           space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                           provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                           id="d207e2517">
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d207e2518">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>Uninstall <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">org-apache-felix-configadmin</fo:inline>,</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d207e2523">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>Install and start <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">org-eclipse-equinox-cm</fo:inline>,</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                             space-before.minimum="2pt"
                             space-before.maximum="2pt"
                             id="d207e2528">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block>Update <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                      font-size="9pt"
                                      letter-spacing="0.08em">jp-co-ntt-admin</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">After the successful reconfiguration, the framework must restart. As
    framework changes must happen in a atomic session, the following
    parameters must be set in a single RPC:</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-before.optimum="1em"
                      space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                      space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                      space-after.optimum="1em"
                      space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                      hyphenate="false"
                      wrap-option="no-wrap"
                      white-space-collapse="false"
                      white-space-treatment="preserve"
                      linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                      text-align="start"
                      font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                      font-size="9pt"
                      letter-spacing="-.0em"
                      space-before="5pt"
                      space-after="3pt"
                      space-after.conditionality="retain"
                      start-indent="inherit"
                      line-height="11pt"
                      id="d207e2534">SetParameterValues {
  Framework.Bundle.org-apache-felix-configadmin.RequestedState = UNINSTALLED
  Framework.Bundle.jp-co-ntt-admin.URL                         = http://....
  Framework.Bundle.org-eclipse-equinox-cm.URL                  = http://....
  Framework.Bundle.org-eclipse-equinox-cm.RequestedState       = ACTIVE
  Framework.Bundle.org-eclipse-equinox-cm.AutoStart            = true
  Framework.Bundle.Systemþ0020Bundle.URL                       = ""
}</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Protocol Adapter must open an atomic session on the $ node as
    defined in the RMT. It will then set all the parameters in the previous
    list. As the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Framework/Bundle/org-eclipse-equinox-cm</fo:inline> node
    does not exist, the TR069 Connector will create it because it is below a
    writable <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">MAP</fo:inline> node. The System Bundle is updated with an empty
    string, signalling an update. A System Bundle update is a framework
    restart.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">Once the session is committed after all the
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">SetParameterValues</fo:inline> elements are executed the Data Plugin will
    perform the actions and report success or failure. The handler must then
    restart the framework after the commit has returned.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="d207e2545">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Native TR-069 Object Models</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>131.7</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Native TR-069 Object Models</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">This section provides an example of a Data Plugin that provides a
    native TR-069 Object Model. As example is chosen a naive implementation of
    the Configuration Admin service. The object model implemented has the
    following definition:</fo:block>
            <fo:block xmlns:rx="http://www.renderx.com/XSL/Extensions" start-indent="0pt">
