                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">ParameterInfo</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
Maps to the TR-069 {@code ParameterInfoStruct} that is returned from the
 {@link TR069Connector#getParameterNames(String, boolean)} method.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
