               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
A service that can create TR069 Connector
   </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.tr069todmt.TR069ConnectorFactory.create-DmtSession-">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>131.8.5.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>public abstract TR069Connector create(DmtSession session)</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>session</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>The session to use for the adaption. This session must not
        be closed before the TR069 Connector is closed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:inline font-weight="normal"
                                            font-style="normal"
                                            baseline-shift="-1pt"
                                            font-size="9pt">□</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
Create a TR069 connector based on the given session .
 </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 The session must be an atomic session when objects are added and/or
 parameters are going to be set, otherwise it can be a read only or
 exclusive session. Due to the lazy creation nature of the TR069 Connector
 it is possible that a node must be created in a read method after a node
 has been added, it is therefore necessary to always provide an atomic
 session when an ACS session requires modifying parameters.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                            space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt"
                            start-indent="0pt"
                            relative-align="baseline">
                     <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                        <fo:list-item>
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                              <fo:block text-align="end" font-style="italic">
                                 <fo:block>Returns</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>A new TR069 Connector bound to the given session</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
